Package: Friedman
Title: Basic Data Analysis Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Erik", "Pihl", email = "epihl@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides basic tools that can be used for data analysis.
    The functions allow users to calculate averages, find minimum and maximum
    values, and summarize data. This helps users better understand their data.
